//    decodes to 0, a missing string to "", and a missing enum to whatever is = 0 --
//    which is the same silent-default disease this schema replaces, relocated into the
//    decoder. Validation asserts PRESENCE, never merely that decoding succeeded.
// 2. Every enum reserves 0 as *_UNSPECIFIED, which validation rejects. An unset TLS mode
//    must be an error, never accidentally the first real value.
